# Copy this file to .env.local and fill in the key. .env.local is git-ignored; never commit a real key.
# Restricted to Android app com.group60.dumplodriver + the team debug SHA-1, and to
# Maps SDK for Android + Routes API. Used by Gradle (map tiles) and by the app (next-stop ETA).
EXPO_PUBLIC_GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=
